  "question": {
    "text": "The product of the slopes of the common tangents of the&nbsp;ellipse <math><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><msup><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>16</mn></math> and the parabola <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>&nbsp;is",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "id": "3wK2N",
      "text": "<math><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>15</mn></mrow></mfrac></math>",
